# The build context of .clusterfuzzlite/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads this file in place of the
# repository's .dockerignore): the lock, the workspace's pyproject files uv needs to read it,
# lakana-core's source and the harnesses.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!packages/*/pyproject.toml
!packages/lakana-core/src/
!fuzz/
!.clusterfuzzlite/build.sh
**/__pycache__
